  "note": "The filter vocabulary. `nullStyle` is a Go-only hint: the default maps Prisma's `field: null` onto the port's IsNull/IsNotNull, and \"literal\" maps it onto Equals(col, nil) to show what the mechanical translation of the shorthand actually does."
}
